\pard \s3\qj\tx314 
{\plain \tab In a further effort to expand the festival\'92s scope, the Global Showcase, a selected package  of traveling 
films from the festival, was created in 1994. The Global Showcase is presented annually in a growing number 
of sites and cities around the world.  The 2000 showcase traveled internationally to Sydney and Melbourne, 
Australia; Lodz, Poland; Cairo, Egypt; and Beirut, Lebanon.   In the United States the showcase has been 
presented in Houston, Texas; St. Louis, Missouri; Albuquerque, New Mexico; Boulder, Colorado; Amherst, 
Massachusetts; Chicago, Illinois; Memphis, Tennessee; Salt Lake City, Utah; Portland, Oregon; Seattle, 
Washington; and Rochester, New York.  The traveling festival plans extensive expansion in Boston, 
Massachusetts and San Francisco, California in January of  2001.}{\plain \fs20 \pard \s3\qj\tx314 
